        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur business is you .... \r\n\r\n3 Bedroom , 3 bathroom Duplex\r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present  No. 20 Seagrave Way, to the Dublin 11 property  market , a beautifully presented three-bedroom, three-bathroom duplex located in the highly sought-after Seagrave development. Recently updated and tastefully decorated, this bright and spacious home offers modern living with high-quality finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nUpon arrival, you are greeted by a private entrance leading to a bright and airy hallway on the first floor. This level features a generously sized double bedroom and a modern family bathroom fitted with quality sanitary ware. The heart of the home is the large open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area. The recently updated kitchen boasts stylish base and eye-level units, quality countertops, and a central island, providing ample storage and workspace. The open-plan layout creates a welcoming and functional space perfect for both entertaining and everyday living. Large windows allow natural light to flood the room, and the living area opens onto a private, sunny balcony overlooking a green area — the perfect spot to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nOn the second floor, you’ll find a spacious primary bedroom with a modern en-suite bathroom and large skylights that fill the room with natural light, creating a bright and tranquil atmosphere. The third double bedroom, also located on this floor, benefits from its own en-suite, ensuring comfort and privacy for all occupants.\r\n\r\nThis property is presented in turn-key condition and has been lovingly maintained by its current owners. It benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, and a designated parking space. The private balcony, which captures the afternoon sun, adds an additional layer of comfort and charm.\r\n\r\nSeagrave is a highly regarded development with excellent transport links and amenities nearby. The property is within easy reach of Dublin City Centre, the M50, Port Tunnel, Dublin City University, and Dublin Airport. Charlestown Shopping Centre and IKEA are both within walking distance, providing convenient access to shopping and dining options. The area also offers a range of recreational facilities, including football pitches, golf courses, and local sports clubs. Additionally, No. 20 Seagrave Way is within an excellent catchment area for both primary and secondary schools, making it an ideal choice for families.\r\n\r\nWith its stylish interior, spacious accommodation, and superb location, No. 20 Seagrave Way is sure to appeal to a range of buyers, including families, , and investors alike. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this exceptional property has to offer.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
